    [
     1,
     "Dear all:<div><br></div><div>This is the first time I´m in touch with the group. I was reading the manuals and videos about distance software but up to date I couldn´t understand well how can I enter my data. Perhaps it´s becuse english is not my language and probably I missed the meaning of some words and concepts.</div><div><br></div><div>To summarise my data has the following characteristicas:</div><div><br></div><div><ul><li>6 vegetation types sampled</li><li>On each site I used point transect methods.</li><li>On each vegattion type I censused bird on three or four points separated each other 100 meters.</li><li>I repeated the census  for three consecutive days</li><li>I sampled all birds seen or heard and estimate the distance (meters) to me.</li><li>The time on each point was 10 minutes.</li><li>After the census  I grouped the data in 10-meter interevals.</li></ul><div>It was difficult for me to assign these data and values to the fields defined by Distance i.e.: Study area - Region - Point Transect - Observation.</div></div><div><br></div><div>For example One of my vegetation type was: </div><div>Ñire open Forest (the study was done on Patagonian Andean Forest ion Argentina)</div><div>12 points censused.</div><div>data grouped in 10-meter bands.</div><div><br></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\">\r\n\r\n <span width=\"133\" style=\"width:100pt\"></span>\r\n <span width=\"90\" style=\"width:68pt\"></span>\r\n <span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\">\r\n  <span colspan=\"2\" height=\"20\" width=\"223\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:168pt\"><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\">\r\n\r\n <span width=\"133\" style=\"width:100pt\"></span>\r\n <span width=\"90\" style=\"width:68pt\"></span>\r\n <span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\">\r\n  <span colspan=\"2\" height=\"20\" width=\"223\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:168pt\"><br>Ñire Open Forest</span></span><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt;border-top:none\"><br>Band   Nr. of BIrds</span><span style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\"><br></span></span><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"min-height:15pt;border-top:none\">10            34</span><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\"><br></span></span><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"min-height:15pt;border-top:none\"><br>20            80</span><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\"><br></span></span><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"min-height:15pt;border-top:none\"><br>30            52 </span><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\"><br></span></span><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"min-height:15pt;border-top:none\"><br>40            17</span><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\"><br></span></span><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"min-height:15pt;border-top:none\"><br>50              3</span><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\"><br></span></span><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"min-height:15pt;border-top:none\"><br>60              6</span><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\"><br></span></span><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt;border-top:none\"><br>TOTAL    1</span><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\">92</span>\r\n </span>\r\n\r\n</span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span colspan=\"2\" height=\"20\" width=\"223\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:168pt\"><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span colspan=\"2\" height=\"20\" width=\"223\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:168pt\"><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\">I hope my questions are clear and I really thanks any help you can give.</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span colspan=\"2\" height=\"20\" width=\"223\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:168pt\"><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span colspan=\"2\" height=\"20\" width=\"223\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:168pt\"><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\">Best</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span colspan=\"2\" height=\"20\" width=\"223\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:168pt\"><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span colspan=\"2\" height=\"20\" width=\"223\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:168pt\"><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"223\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:168pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span align=\"right\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none\">Gustavo</span></span></span></span></span></span></div>"
